"ai_disruption":[0,0,0,0.0]},"move":{"r1":0.0195,"r5":-0.0028,"r20":0.0455,"r1_spy":0.0123,"r5_spy":-0.039,"r20_spy":0.0058}}],"quotes":[{"c":"AM 2019 Q2","e":"am","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"We expect this track record to continue even at current commodity strip pricing which is driven by AR's 10% to 14% well cost reduction initiatives that I will discuss on Slide four, titled Cost Reduction Initiatives Breakdown.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-midstream-gp-lp-am-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AM 2019 Q2","e":"am","d":"2019-08-01","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul M. Rady","x":"The outcome is well cost savings of $1.2 million to $1.7 million per well for a 12,000 foot lateral bringing AR's targeted well cost to $0.83 million to $0.87 million per 1,000 feel lateral.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-midstream-gp-lp-am-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AM 2019 Q2","e":"am","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Spiro Dounis","x":"You've come out, you've reiterated guidance, you've talked to some new opportunities, you've talked to capital efficiencies and it doesn't seem to be having an impact.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-midstream-gp-lp-am-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AM 2019 Q2","e":"am","d":"2019-08-01","l":"guidance","r":"analyst","s":"Spiro Dounis","x":"But if I'm echoing some feedback we receive, it seems to be ongoing concerns around counter-party risk and basin risk and it just doesn't seem like reiterating guidance is going to be enough to appease that?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/05/antero-midstream-gp-lp-am-q2-2019-earnings-call-tr.aspx"},{"c":"AM 2019 Q3","e":"am","d":"2019-10-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Paul Rady","x":"Thanks, Mike, I'd like to start by discussing the expensive cost savings effort